    "ar": "البريد الإلكتروني مطلوب.",
    "en": "Email is required.",
    "usedIn": "AddContactRequest, AddRepresentativeRequest, ForgotPasswordRequest, InviteStaffRequest, InviteSupplierUserRequest, LoginRequest, RegisterSupplierRequest"
